      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a natural reaction to feel like a ghost when the world you once knew has vanished, but that version of you is already gone, so there's no point in pretending to be someone else anymore. You don't have to keep up the act when the person you were has already died; it's time to stop trying to be the ghost and finally let go of the corpse.",
