    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the ghost fade away\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a dark way. like there's finally an end to the noise. but i don't know how to just fade. i'm still stuck here, physically, in this life that feels like a hollow shell. is there really no other way to just... make it stop? to not have to deal with the embarrassment and the emptiness anymore?",
